        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ANNSIM-SIMAUD-PHASE1-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-PHASE1-INGESTION-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TOTAL-STREAMS            PIC 9(04) VALUE 0096.
            05  WS-TEXT-BYTES-EXTRACTED     PIC 9(06) VALUE 033630.
            05  WS-RFC1951-INFLATE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-PHASE1-PROOF-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-INGESTION-BOUNDS.
            GOBACK.
        1000-VERIFY-INGESTION-BOUNDS.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TOTAL-STREAMS = 0096 AND
               WS-TEXT-BYTES-EXTRACTED > 30000 AND
               WS-RFC1951-INFLATE-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-PHASE1-PROOF-CODE
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-PHASE1-PROOF-CODE.
